# (AI-assisted) Jak II: texture animation and ocean views (j2-texanim). Title (ocean), the slums
# (security walls in ctywide, Jak), the forest (waterfall), the drill platform level dig1 (lava).
# Shots named for side by side images against the PC renderer (same pad).
300 shot title_0
500 shot title_1
700 shot title_a
900 shot title_b
1000 continue ctysluma-start
1001 -
1002 wait *target* target-stance
1003 log stop: slums
1300 shot slums_stand
1301 rx=0
1360 -
1361 shot slums_turn
1362 rx=0
1420 -
1421 shot slums_turn2
1500 continue forest-start
1501 -
1502 wait *target* target-stance
1503 log stop: forest
1800 shot forest_a
1801 rx=0
1860 -
1861 shot forest_b
1900 continue dig1-start
1901 -
1902 wait *target* target-stance
1903 log stop: dig1
2200 shot dig1_a
2201 rx=0
2260 -
2261 shot dig1_b
2300 continue ctyport-start
2301 -
2302 wait *target* target-stance
2303 log stop: port
2600 shot port_a
2601 rx=0
2660 -
2661 shot port_b
2700 exit
